msgid "Instagram posts are paused because Fair Events Experimental does not manage the Instagram connection on this site yet. Open Fair Events → Instagram for what to do. The notification’s settings are kept, and posting resumes with the next scheduled week."
msgstr "Les publications Instagram sont en pause car Fair Events Experimental ne gère pas encore la connexion Instagram sur ce site. Ouvrez Fair Events → Instagram pour savoir quoi faire. Les paramètres de la notification sont conservés et la publication reprend la semaine suivante prévue."

